# 📖 About

This repository is designed for students and beginners who want to practice SQL using a real dataset.

It includes complete examples of:

- Database Creation
- Table Creation
- Data Insertion
- Data Modification
- Filtering
- Sorting
- Joins
- Aggregate Functions
- String Functions
- Subqueries

